#. y1:english="My name's Moxa from Purgatory.{PA:10}||I work for Kage.\nDo you have any spare time||to meet with Kage?\nApparently Kage's been having family||problems.{PA:20} He's all bent outta shape...\nand won't tell us a single thing.\nKage has a family?\nHe had a family, a long time ago.\nHis son grew up to be a punk, no different||from the ones roaming these very streets...\nIt's sad, the kid doesn't even know||what his father looks like.\n"
#: MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/DAY_KAB0001.BIN:82_0_8
msgctxt "MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/DAY_KAB0001.BIN::line:82_0_8"
msgid "Es muy triste,{PA:10}||el chico ni sabe cómo es su padre."
msgstr ""

